# Pairs with NonDisclosure. Reporting an unregistered granting tenant apart
# from an unoffered grant lets the grantee's admins probe for tenants.
MODULE: RevokeTellsUnregisteredGranter
TARGET: NonDisclosure
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: revoke reports an unregistered granting tenant as tenant-not-found
PERTURBS: Revoke

--- FIND
       ELSE IF ~present THEN Refuse("revoke", c, a, present, preActive, "notFound")
--- REPLACE
       ELSE IF ~present THEN Refuse("revoke", c, a, present, preActive, IF status["A"] = "active" THEN "notFound" ELSE "tenantNotFound")
--- END